menu "NRM-HA Mount"

    config NRM_TEST_BUILD
        bool "Test firmware build (ignore external-power gating)"
        default n
        help
            Enables test-only behaviour: the external-power sensor is bypassed
            and the motors are always treated as powered, so the firmware can
            be driven over USB without the 12V rail connected.

            Do NOT enable this on a production mount: it disables the safety
            that prevents motion while the motors are unpowered.

endmenu
